data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_047c6fc410e7546b016acc3c110f288197b16c595a55653085","output_index":0,"sequence_number":87,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test lines**\n\nI'm thinking about whether adding a test with 80 lines is too much or just enough. On one hand, it doesn't seem overkill if it covers everything needed, but I want to make sure it's effective without being excessive. It's a fine balance! I wonder if I’ll get the right feedback with that number of lines and if it's going to be meaningful. This might be just the right amount to thoroughly check everything!"}

